-- NORM-LOG N10 goal A: an operand reads its own chain's write made at the same event.
-- Pass: FULFILLED on all three traces, as before A.
IMPORT prelude
DECLARE Person IS ONE OF patron
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF go, later
GIVETH DEONTIC Person Action
own MEANS
  PARTY patron MAY go
  HENCE RECORD `flag` IS TRUE
  HENCE (IF RECALL patron's `flag` EQUALS NOTHING THEN BREACH ELSE (PARTY patron MAY later WITHIN 10))
GIVETH DEONTIC Person Action
other MEANS PARTY patron MAY later WITHIN 100
#TRACE own AT 0 WITH PARTY patron DOES go AT 5  PARTY patron DOES later AT 6
#TRACE own RAND other AT 0 WITH PARTY patron DOES go AT 5  PARTY patron DOES later AT 6
#TRACE other RAND own AT 0 WITH PARTY patron DOES go AT 5  PARTY patron DOES later AT 6
